  "claude_notes": "Seed memory. Categories map to folders relative to the scanned directory. Rules win over the category table; dir-scoped rules win over global ones. Prefer reusing existing categories over inventing new folders. 'move-to' targets must be absolute paths (~ allowed) listed in 'targets'."
